---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Integrações & Chaves de API | Nicopel Cargo">
  <div class="page-integracoes">
    <div class="header-section">
      <div class="title-group">
        <h1><i class="fas fa-key"></i> Integrações & Chaves de API</h1>
        <p>Gere e gerencie chaves de API com validade para integrar a Nicopel Cargo com sistemas externos e planilhas do Excel.</p>
      </div>
      <button id="btn-new-key" class="btn-primary">
        <i class="fas fa-plus"></i> Gerar Nova Chave
      </button>
    </div>

    <!-- Container do Token Gerado (Exibido uma única vez por segurança) -->
    <div id="new-key-success-card" class="glass-card new-key-success" style="display: none;">
      <div class="success-header">
        <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
        <h3>Chave de API Gerada com Sucesso!</h3>
      </div>
      <p class="warning-text"><i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle"></i> Por motivos de segurança, copie a chave agora. Você não poderá visualizá-la novamente.</p>
      <div class="key-display-box">
        <code id="raw-key-value">np_live_...</code>
        <button id="btn-copy-raw-key" class="btn-icon" title="Copiar Chave"><i class="fas fa-copy"></i></button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-layout">
      <!-- Painel Esquerdo: Minhas Chaves -->
      <div class="glass-card animate-fade-in">
        <div class="card-header-premium">
          <h2 class="card-title"><i class="fas fa-list"></i> Chaves de API Ativas</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="table-responsive">
          <table class="data-table">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Nome</th>
                <th>Usuário</th>
                <th>Permissão</th>
                <th>Expira em</th>
                <th>Criada em</th>
                <th class="text-right">Ações</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody id="keys-table-body">
              <tr>
                <td colspan="6" class="loading-state">
                  <i class="fas fa-circle-notch fa-spin"></i>
                  <span>Carregando chaves...</span>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Painel Direito: Guias Práticos -->
      <div class="glass-card instructions-card">
        <div class="card-header-premium">
          <h2 class="card-title"><i class="fas fa-book"></i> Guias de Integração</h2>
        </div>
        
        <div class="tabs">
          <button class="tab-btn active" data-tab="tab-excel"><i class="fas fa-file-excel"></i> Microsoft Excel</button>
          <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="tab-graphql"><i class="fas fa-code"></i> GraphQL API</button>
        </div>

        <div class="tab-content active" id="tab-excel">
          <h3>Como usar os dados no Excel / Power Query:</h3>
          <ol class="steps-list">
            <li>Gere uma chave de API do tipo <strong>Apenas Leitura (READ_ONLY)</strong> no botão acima.</li>
            <li>No Excel, vá na aba <strong>Dados</strong> > <strong>Obter Dados</strong> > <strong>De Outras Fontes</strong> > <strong>Da Web</strong>.</li>
            <li>Selecione a opção <strong>Básico</strong> e cole a URL de exportação abaixo:
              <div class="code-copy-box">
                <code id="excel-url-display">https://cotacao.nicopel.com.br/api/integration/excel/quotations?apiKey=SUA_CHAVE_AQUI</code>
                <button id="btn-copy-excel-url" class="btn-icon"><i class="fas fa-copy"></i></button>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li>Clique em <strong>OK</strong>. O Excel importará os dados formatados em colunas automaticamente.</li>
          </ol>
        </div>

        <div class="tab-content" id="tab-graphql">
          <h3>Como interagir com a GraphQL API:</h3>
          <p>Você pode testar e consumir a API executando requisições POST para <code>/graphql</code> enviando o header <code>X-API-Key</code>.</p>
          <pre class="code-block"><code>{`query {
  externalQuotations(limit: 10) {
    id
    status
    valor_total_produtos
    client {
      razao_social
      cnpj
    }
  }
}`}</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Modal de Nova Chave -->
  <div id="key-modal" class="modal-key">
    <div class="modal-content glass-premium">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <h2>Gerar Chave de API</h2>
        <button class="close-modal">&times;</button>
      </div>
      <form id="key-form">
        <div class="modal-body-scroll">
          <div class="form-section ux-square">
            <h3 class="section-title"><i class="fas fa-info-circle"></i> Configuração da Chave</h3>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="key-name">Nome Identificador</label>
              <input type="text" id="key-name" required placeholder="Ex: Planilha de Faturamento Excel" />
            </div>
            <div class="form-grid-inner">
              <div class="form-group">
                <label for="key-validity">Validade da Chave</label>
                <select id="key-validity" required>
                  <option value="30">30 dias</option>
                  <option value="90">90 dias</option>
                  <option value="365">365 dias (1 ano)</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div class="form-group" id="role-group" style="display: none;">
                <label for="key-role">Nível de Permissão</label>
                <select id="key-role">
                  <option value="READ_ONLY">Apenas Leitura (READ_ONLY)</option>
                  <option value="FULL_ACCESS">Acesso Total (FULL_ACCESS)</option>
                </select>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="modal-footer">
          <button type="button" class="btn-secondary close-modal">Cancelar</button>
          <button type="submit" class="btn-primary">Confirmar e Gerar</button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>

<script is:inline>
  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
    const tableBody = document.getElementById('keys-table-body');
    const modal = document.getElementById('key-modal');
    const btnNewKey = document.getElementById('btn-new-key');
    const closeModalBtns = document.querySelectorAll('.close-modal');
    const keyForm = document.getElementById('key-form');
    const successCard = document.getElementById('new-key-success-card');
    const rawKeyValue = document.getElementById('raw-key-value');
    const btnCopyRawKey = document.getElementById('btn-copy-raw-key');
    const roleGroup = document.getElementById('role-group');
    const excelUrlDisplay = document.getElementById('excel-url-display');
    const btnCopyExcelUrl = document.getElementById('btn-copy-excel-url');

    const user = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('user_info') || '{}');

    // Mostra opção de nível apenas para Admins
    if (user.role === 'ADMIN') {
      roleGroup.style.display = 'block';
    }

    // Configura a URL base de exemplo do Excel
    const apiBase = window.PUBLIC_API_URL || window.location.origin;
    const excelExportUrl = `${apiBase}/api/integration/excel/quotations?apiKey=SUA_CHAVE_AQUI`;
    excelUrlDisplay.textContent = excelExportUrl;

    // Busca e renderiza as chaves
    async function loadKeys() {
      try {
        const res = await window.safeFetch('/api/api-keys');
        if (!res.ok) throw new Error();
        const keys = res.data || [];
        
        if (keys.length === 0) {
          tableBody.innerHTML = `<tr><td colspan="6" class="text-center" style="padding: 40px 20px; color: #64748b; font-weight: 800;">Nenhuma chave de API gerada.</td></tr>`;
          return;
        }

        tableBody.innerHTML = keys.map(k => `
          <tr>
            <td><strong>${k.name}</strong></td>
            <td>${k.user?.username || 'Você'}</td>
            <td>
              <span class="role-badge ${k.role === 'FULL_ACCESS' ? 'admin' : 'seller'}">
                ${k.role}
              </span>
            </td>
            <td>${new Date(k.expiresAt).toLocaleDateString('pt-BR')}</td>
            <td>${new Date(k.createdAt).toLocaleDateString('pt-BR')}</td>
            <td class="text-right">
              <div class="action-btns">
                <button class="action-btn edit btn-delete-key" data-id="${k.id}" style="color: #ef4444;" title="Revogar Chave">
                  <i class="fas fa-trash"></i>
                </button>
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>
        `).join('');

        // Vincula botões de delete
        document.querySelectorAll('.btn-delete-key').forEach(btn => {
          btn.onclick = async () => {
            if (confirm('Tem certeza que deseja revogar esta chave de API? Ela parará de funcionar imediatamente.')) {
              await window.safeFetch(`/api/api-keys/${btn.dataset.id}`, { method: 'DELETE' });
              window.showToast('Chave de API revogada com sucesso.', 'info');
              loadKeys();
            }
          };
        });
      } catch (err) {
        tableBody.innerHTML = `<tr><td colspan="6" class="text-center text-danger" style="padding: 40px 20px; font-weight: 800;">Erro ao carregar chaves de API.</td></tr>`;
      }
    }

    loadKeys();

    // Modal
    btnNewKey.onclick = () => modal.style.display = 'flex';
    closeModalBtns.forEach(btn => btn.onclick = () => modal.style.display = 'none');
    window.onclick = (e) => { if (e.target === modal) modal.style.display = 'none'; };

    // Formulário de Criação
    keyForm.onsubmit = async (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      const name = (document.getElementById('key-name') as HTMLInputElement).value;
      const expiresDays = +(document.getElementById('key-validity') as HTMLSelectElement).value;
      const role = (document.getElementById('key-role') as HTMLSelectElement)?.value || 'READ_ONLY';

      try {
        const res = await window.safeFetch('/api/api-keys', {
          method: 'POST',
          headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
          body: JSON.stringify({ name, expiresDays, role })
        });

        if (res.ok) {
          window.showToast('Chave de API criada com sucesso!', 'success');
          modal.style.display = 'none';
          
          // Exibe o card do token gerado temporariamente
          successCard.style.display = 'block';
          rawKeyValue.textContent = res.data.rawKey;
          
          // Atualiza a URL do Excel de exemplo com a chave criada
          excelUrlDisplay.textContent = `${apiBase}/api/integration/excel/quotations?apiKey=${res.data.rawKey}`;

          btnCopyRawKey.onclick = () => {
            navigator.clipboard.writeText(res.data.rawKey);
            window.showToast('Chave copiada para a área de transferência!', 'success');
          };

          keyForm.reset();
          loadKeys();
        } else {
          window.showToast('Erro ao gerar chave de API.', 'error');
        }
      } catch (err) {
        window.showToast('Erro de conexão.', 'error');
      }
    };

    // Copiar URL do Excel
    btnCopyExcelUrl.onclick = () => {
      navigator.clipboard.writeText(excelUrlDisplay.textContent);
      window.showToast('URL de exportação copiada!', 'success');
    };

    // Tabs
    document.querySelectorAll('.tab-btn').forEach(btn => {
      btn.onclick = () => {
        document.querySelectorAll('.tab-btn').forEach(b => b.classList.remove('active'));
        document.querySelectorAll('.tab-content').forEach(c => c.classList.remove('active'));
        btn.classList.add('active');
        document.getElementById(btn.dataset.tab).classList.add('active');
      };
    });
  });
</script>

<style is:global>
  /* --- SCOPED GLOBAL PARA PREVENIR LEAKS E IGUALAR O LAYOUT --- */
  .page-integracoes .header-section {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .page-integracoes .title-group h1 {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #0f172a;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 15px;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }

  .page-integracoes .title-group h1 i { color: #004a99; }
  .page-integracoes .title-group p { color: #64748b; font-size: 1.1rem; }

  .page-integracoes .grid-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
    gap: 30px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .page-integracoes .grid-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .page-integracoes .glass-card {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 28px;
    border: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0;
    padding: 30px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
  }

  .page-integracoes .table-responsive {
    overflow-x: auto;
    margin-top: 15px;
  }

  .page-integracoes .data-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
  .page-integracoes .data-table th { 
    padding: 20px 16px; text-align: left; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 900; color: #64748b; 
    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; border-bottom: 2px solid #f8fafc;
    background: #fbfcfe;
  }
  .page-integracoes .data-table td { padding: 18px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; vertical-align: middle; color: #334155; font-size: 0.9rem; }
  .page-integracoes .data-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
  .page-integracoes .data-table tr:hover td { background: #f8fafc; }

  .page-integracoes .role-badge { 
    padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 900; 
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .page-integracoes .role-badge.admin { background: #fee2e2; color: #991b1b; }
  .page-integracoes .role-badge.seller { background: #eff6ff; color: #1e40af; }

  .page-integracoes .action-btns { display: flex; gap: 10px; justify-content: flex-end; }
  .page-integracoes .action-btn { 
    width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 14px; border: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0; 
    background: white; color: #64748b; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1); 
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .page-integracoes .action-btn:hover { border-color: #ef4444; color: #ef4444; transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 8px 15px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1); }

  /* Premium Buttons */
  .page-integracoes .btn-primary { 
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #004a99, #003366); color: white; border: none;
    padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 12px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.9rem;
    cursor: pointer; transition: 0.3s; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 74, 153, 0.3);
  }
  .page-integracoes .btn-primary:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); filter: brightness(1.1); box-shadow: 0 15px 25px -5px rgba(0, 74, 153, 0.4); }

  .page-integracoes .btn-secondary { 
    background: #f1f5f9; color: #475569; border: none; padding: 12px 20px; 
    border-radius: 12px; font-weight: 800; cursor: pointer; transition: 0.2s;
  }
  .page-integracoes .btn-secondary:hover { background: #e2e8f0; color: #1e293b; }

  /* Success Banner */
  .page-integracoes .new-key-success {
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.05) !important;
    border: 2px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2) !important;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .page-integracoes .success-header h3 { font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 900; color: #10b981; }

  /* Tabs UX */
  .page-integracoes .tabs { display: flex; gap: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; margin-bottom: 25px; margin-top: 15px; }
  .page-integracoes .tab-btn {
    background: none; border: none; color: #64748b; padding: 12px 20px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.9rem; transition: all 0.2s;
    border-bottom: 3px solid transparent;
  }
  .page-integracoes .tab-btn.active { color: #004a99; border-color: #004a99; }
  .page-integracoes .tab-btn i { margin-right: 8px; }

  .page-integracoes .tab-content h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 900; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .page-integracoes .steps-list { padding-left: 20px; color: #475569; font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .page-integracoes .steps-list li { margin-bottom: 15px; }

  .page-integracoes .code-copy-box {
    display: flex; background: #f8fafc; padding: 12px 18px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 10px; gap: 15px;
  }
  .page-integracoes .code-copy-box code { font-size: 0.85rem; font-family: monospace; color: #004a99; font-weight: 800; word-break: break-all; }
  .page-integracoes .code-block { background: #0f172a; padding: 20px; border-radius: 16px; color: #e2e8f0; font-size: 0.85rem; overflow-x: auto; margin-top: 10px; }

  /* Modal Framework */
  .page-integracoes .modal-key {
    position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    z-index: 2000; display: none; justify-content: center; align-items: center; padding: 20px;
  }
  .page-integracoes .modal-content {
    background: white; width: 100%; max-width: 600px; border-radius: 28px; box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
  }
  .page-integracoes .modal-header { padding: 20px 30px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; }
  .page-integracoes .modal-header h2 { font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 900; color: #0f172a; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .page-integracoes .close-modal { background: #f1f5f9; border: none; width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 50%; color: #64748b; font-size: 1.2rem; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; transition: 0.2s; }
  .page-integracoes .close-modal:hover { background: #fee2e2; color: #ef4444; transform: rotate(90deg); }

  .page-integracoes .modal-body-scroll { padding: 25px 30px; overflow-y: auto; max-height: 60vh; }
  .page-integracoes .modal-footer { padding: 16px 30px; border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9; background: #fbfcfe; display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 16px; }

  /* UX Form Elements */
  .page-integracoes .form-section.ux-square { background: #f8fafc; padding: 20px; border-radius: 20px; border: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0; }
  .page-integracoes .section-title { font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 900; color: #004a99; margin-bottom: 15px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; }
  .page-integracoes .form-group { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .page-integracoes .form-group label { font-weight: 800; color: #334155; font-size: 0.8rem; padding-left: 4px; }
  .page-integracoes .form-group input, .page-integracoes .form-group select {
    padding: 10px 14px !important; border-radius: 12px !important; border: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0 !important; outline: none; transition: 0.2s; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #0f172a; background: white !important;
  }
  .page-integracoes .form-group input:focus, .page-integracoes .form-group select:focus { border-color: #004a99 !important; box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(0, 74, 153, 0.1) !important; }
  .page-integracoes .form-grid-inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 15px; }
</style>
